255
00:14:33.993 --> 00:14:35.081
Redis Cluster.

256
00:14:35.361 --> 00:14:36.087
P:

257
00:14:36.367 --> 00:14:37.284
A or C:

258
00:14:37.564 --> 00:14:40.316
A-ish (async replication, can lose writes).

259
00:14:40.596 --> 00:14:41.236
