437
00:27:25.798 --> 00:27:32.113
Two phases per value: prepare or promise with a ballot number, then accept or accepted by a majority.

438
00:27:32.393 --> 00:27:36.403
Proposers adopt the highest-ballot accepted value they learn about.

439
00:27:36.683 --> 00:27:37.601
