450
00:28:00.265 --> 00:28:01.182
ZooKeeper.

451
00:28:01.462 --> 00:28:02.913
Viewstamped Replication.

452
00:28:03.193 --> 00:28:03.982
Idea:

453
00:28:04.262 --> 00:28:05.947
View changes with a primary.

454
00:28:06.227 --> 00:28:09.961
It predates Paxos's publication and is very close to Raft.

455
00:28:10.241 --> 00:28:11.158
Used by:

456
00:28:11.438 --> 00:28:13.401
Academic, some storage systems.

457
00:28:14.751 --> 00:28:16.287
EPaxos or leaderless.

458
00:28:16.567 --> 00:28:17.356
Idea:

459
00:28:17.636 --> 00:28:22.479
Any replica can lead a command, and only conflicting commands need extra rounds.

460
00:28:22.759 --> 00:28:23.676
Used by:

461
00:28:23.956 --> 00:28:26.452
Research, some geo-distributed systems.

462
00:28:26.732 --> 00:28:29.655
Byzantine (PBFT, HotStuff, Tendermint).

463
00:28:29.935 --> 00:28:30.724
