464
00:28:31.004 --> 00:28:33.820
Tolerate lying nodes, 3f + 1 nodes.

465
00:28:34.100 --> 00:28:35.017
Used by:

466
00:28:35.297 --> 00:28:38.881
Blockchains; not needed inside one company's trust boundary.

467
00:28:40.231 --> 00:28:53.607
For interviews: know Raft well, know that Multi-Paxos and Raft are structurally similar (a leader, terms or ballots, majority acceptance), and know why Byzantine tolerance isn't used for internal systems.

468
00:28:54.957 --> 00:28:56.813
Reading from a consensus system.

469
00:28:57.093 --> 00:28:58.480
Writes go through the log.

470
00:28:58.760 --> 00:29:07.784
Reads are the subtle part: a leader can't simply answer from its own state, because it may have been deposed without knowing it (partitioned away, or paused).

