01:17:40.627 --> 01:18:04.371
Leadership per job: current holder, token, leadership changes per hour, time without a leader, fenced rejections (each one is a caught pause or partition, so log it with details). etcd: hasleader, leaderchangesseentotal, proposalsfailedtotal, WAL fsync and backend commit p99, DB size versus quota, watchers, gRPC error rates, peer round-trip time.

1144
01:18:04.651 --> 01:18:16.235
