1427
01:37:01.857 --> 01:37:04.139
Vector or version vectors + merge.

1428
01:37:04.419 --> 01:37:06.403
Timeouts, retries, rate limits:

1429
01:37:06.683 --> 01:37:08.134
System.nanoTime().

1430
01:37:09.484 --> 01:37:11.276
Linearizable read from Raft:

1431
01:37:11.556 --> 01:37:16.249
ReadIndex (default); lease reads only with a drift bound + check-quorum.

1432
01:37:16.529 --> 01:37:19.004
Strict serializability across regions:

1433
01:37:19.284 --> 01:37:23.679
Spanner or CockroachDB-class database, and accept the commit latency.

1434
01:37:23.959 --> 01:37:25.281
